  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 302.01 Dam Inventory",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 302.01 Dam Inventory. The department shall maintain an inventory of all jurisdictional dams in the state as to ownership, height, location, and hazard classification.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; amd by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff\n\n8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
